            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384150/extras/63eab13d33f1a1099a152a21e99c56ac.avif?t=1501870240\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br>Take control of a rogue ship and and wage war against endless waves of foes in TeraBlaster! Featuring classic top-down shooter mechanics and smooth addictive gameplay, TeraBlaster will put your reflexes to the test while you hurl gamma-grenades against your foes.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384150/extras/ae7539dea947851447daf1157a2fba7a.webp?t=1501870240\" width=378 height=24 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore procedurally generated environments<br></li><li>Ruthlessly destroy hordes of enemy spacecraft<br></li><li>Experience endless compelling gameplay<br></li><li>Engage with the philosophical and quirky backstory<br></li><li>Treat your ears to the gloriously retro OST</li></ul><br>TeraBlaster inspired fast-paced action roguelikes including Overture (available for purchase here!)<br><br><br>",
